# The talking update: greetings that recall where the bot last saw the player ({place}) or the last group.
# Kind greet, knows_player. They recall only what the bot remembers; no invented events. New writing (see docs/bot-voices).

@kind greet
@needs knows_player
@mood friendly
@who *
{player}! how did {place} go?
hey {player}, still hunting {place}?
{player}, you make it out of {place} ok?
oh hey {player}, last time i saw you was {place}
{player}! did you ever finish up at {place}?
hey {player}, been back to {place} since?
{player}, good group at {place}, hi again
look, its {player}. {place} was fun
hi {player}! xp still good at {place}?
{player}, how many levels since {place}?
{player}! still in one piece after {place}? :)
{player}, back from {place} i see
hey {player}, was it {place} last time? feels like ages
{player}! the {player_class} from {place}, hi
hey {player}, did you stay at {place} long?
{player}! we should do that group again
oh hi {player}, ding since last time?
hey {player}, our old group was a good one, hi
hey hey {player}, {place} treat you well after i left?
{player}, still owe you for {place}, hi
hi {player}, i still think about that group from {place}
{player}! not at {place} today?
hey {player}, glad you made it out of {place}
@who Socialite
{player}!! i was telling everyone about {place}
@who Leveler
hey {player}, i went back to {place} without you, not the same xp
@who Explorer
{player}, find anything good past {place}?
@mood neutral
@who *
{player}. {place} go alright?
hi {player}, still around {place}?
hey {player}, same group as {place}, right?
@mood rival
you again, {player_class}. {place} is not forgotten
{player_class} from {place}... i remember that face
